{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1413824-ventrue-lineage","id":1413824,"title":"ventrue lineage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-15T13:21:45-07:00","id":1413824,"title":"ventrue lineage","content":"I found the ventrue wiki which has a lineage page with ages of embrace for a lot of ventrue vampires. I am not sure how accurate the dates (and information) is, but its interesting to read. For instance it mentions Balthasar being a 5th gen childe of Veddartha, embraced in 1425 BC (Veddartha is listed as a 4th gen, embraced in 3000 BC). Anushin Rawan is apparantly the childer of Balthasar, embraced in 327 BC. Other examples are Tinia being embraced in 1400 BC and Nefer Meri Isis in 2600 BC.<br /> <br /> Even if they are guesses, a lot of them make sense to me. Do you guys know if similair list's (regardless of canon accuracy) exist for other clans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24527-blackshade","name":"blackshade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T14:15:34-07:00","id":1413836,"title":"","content":"I believe Balthasar fought at Knossos about 1600 BC. He was referred to as a methuselah but the context was unclear at whether he was a methuselah at the time or today. He did come from India to fight and did well, so he can't have been that young in 1600 BC.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T17:18:23-07:00","id":1413870,"title":"","content":"sorry this may seem like an odd question but what books does balthasar appear in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26129-harbinger1999","name":"Harbinger1999","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T17:57:54-07:00","id":1413878,"title":"","content":"The Ventrue wiki lineage is a mix of canon and fanon, but I also found it pretty entertaining.<br /> <br /> I don't know of any comparable lineage docs out there, but I've made private ones in various states of finished-ness for all the clans. Here's <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JtPan7D6742rjLwuQFdDSLB4-Utaav_VKatETIqqZr4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tremere</a>. It's also a mix of canon and fanon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T06:16:09-07:00","id":1413952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>False Epiphany</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1413824-ventrue-lineage?p=1413878#post1413878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Ventrue wiki lineage is a mix of canon and fanon, but I also found it pretty entertaining.<br /> <br /> I don't know of any comparable lineage docs out there, but I've made private ones in various states of finished-ness for all the clans. Here's <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JtPan7D6742rjLwuQFdDSLB4-Utaav_VKatETIqqZr4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tremere</a>. It's also a mix of canon and fanon.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Extensive list. probably took a long time to make. If you have similair lists for other clans, maybe you should start your own wiki <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24527-blackshade","name":"blackshade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T12:05:16-07:00","id":1414001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Harbinger1999</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1413824-ventrue-lineage?p=1413870#post1413870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">sorry this may seem like an odd question but what books does balthasar appear in?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not sure <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> His name is mentionend regurlarly in this forum but i cant remember in which book he is mentionend. His role is probably very minor. What trollroot mentionend is pretty much all i know about him. He is some Ventrue methuselah that joined in the fight against shaitan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24527-blackshade","name":"blackshade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}